SELECT cm.`Country`, MAX(cd.`Horsepower`) AS MaxHorsepower
FROM countries AS c
JOIN car_makers AS cm ON c.`CountryId` = cm.`Country`
JOIN model_list AS ml ON ml.`Maker` = cm.`Id`
JOIN cars_data AS cd ON cd.`Id` = ml.`Model`
WHERE c.`CountryName` = 'japan'
GROUP BY cm.`Country`
```

Sub question 2: For each country, check if all car makers in that country have at least one model with horsepower greater than the maximum horsepower of Japan's models.
