Show the name and the release year of the song by the youngest singer.

Sub question 1: Find the age of the youngest singer.
SQL
```sql
SELECT MIN(Age) FROM singer
```
Sub question 2: Show name and release year for the singer with that age.
SQL
```sql
SELECT Song_Name, Song_release_year 
FROM singer 
WHERE Age = (SELECT MIN(Age) FROM singer)

Final SQL
```sql
SELECT `Song_Name`, `Song_release_year` 
FROM singer 
WHERE Age = (SELECT MIN(Age) FROM singer)
```

