【Question】
for the players born before 1935, list their game num and game id

Decompose the question into sub questions, generate SQL for each, and then the Final SQL:


====================

Sub question 1: Find the player IDs of players born before 1935.
SQL
```sql
SELECT player_id FROM player WHERE birth_year < 1935
```

Sub question 2: For these players, find their game numbers and game IDs from the all_star table.
SQL
```sql
SELECT game_num, game_id FROM all_star WHERE player_id IN (SELECT player_id FROM player WHERE birth_year < 1935)
```

Final SQL
```sql
SELECT game_num, game_id FROM all_star WHERE player_id IN (SELECT player_id FROM player WHERE birth_year < 1935)
```

